      "content": "a pivot? there is no pivot. i'm thirty years old and i have nothing to show for it. my reputation is gone. if i try to start over, i'm just a person who failed at something they were supposed to be good at. the shame is just... it's suffocating. i feel like the person i was supposed to be is just gone, and the person that's left is someone i don't even want to be. i just feel like everything is pointless now. is it even worth trying to rebuild anything when the foundation is just completely broken?",
